00:21:44.590 --> 00:21:47.910
And I will tell you, it was real peanut butter.
我要告诉你，那是真正的花生酱。

467
00:21:48.130 --> 00:21:50.870
But Rain did not put it on Steve's head.
但雷恩并没有把它抹在史蒂夫头上。

468
00:21:50.990 --> 00:21:52.870
It was our hairstylist, Kim Ferry.
那是我们的发型师，金·费里。

469
00:21:53.090 --> 00:21:54.530
She would get it all set.
她会把一切都准备妥当。

470
00:21:54.850 --> 00:21:59.490
And then Rain would step in and just do kind of like that last little touch.
然后雷恩走进来，做最后那点收尾工作。

471
00:21:59.810 --> 00:22:01.510
And then do the massaging part.
接着做按摩的部分。

472
00:22:01.670 --> 00:22:03.870
And then she'd have to fix it between takes.
然后她得在镜头拍摄间隙重新整理好。

473
00:22:03.870 --> 00:22:08.850
And I found out that it only took a few takes to get this part of the scene.
我了解到，这场戏只拍了几个镜头就完成了。

474
00:22:09.150 --> 00:22:14.730
And afterwards, they scheduled a scene that Steve was not in so that he could go back to
之后，他们安排了一场没有史蒂夫的戏，这样他就可以回到

