00:22:14.730 --> 00:22:17.430
the hair and makeup trailer and get his hair all washed out.
发型和化妆房把头发洗干净。

476
00:22:17.710 --> 00:22:18.950
Kim had to, like, shampoo it.
金不得不像洗头那样帮他清洗。

477
00:22:19.430 --> 00:22:19.810
Oh, yeah.
哦，是的。

478
00:22:19.990 --> 00:22:24.470
In our hair and makeup trailer, you guys, they had, like, a traditional, you know, in a hair
在我们的发型和化妆房里，伙计们，他们有那种传统的，你知道的，理发店里

