00:22:24.470 --> 00:22:28.690
salon, that sink you lean back in because it's got the little divot cut out, you know?
那种可以往后靠的洗头盆，因为上面有个小凹槽，你知道吧？

480
00:22:28.850 --> 00:22:29.070
Yeah.
对。

481
00:22:29.270 --> 00:22:30.390
They had a thing like that.
他们有那种设备。

482
00:22:30.390 --> 00:22:33.770
So they could wash your hair if you needed your hair washed.
所以如果需要洗头的话，他们可以在那里洗。

483
00:22:33.870 --> 00:22:35.950
But the water was not very warm.
但是水温一点也不暖和。

484
00:22:36.190 --> 00:22:37.590
Oh, it was ice cold.
哦，冰凉刺骨。

485
00:22:37.910 --> 00:22:38.350
Yeah.
是的。

486
00:22:38.690 --> 00:22:43.730
Well, Angela, I'll have you know that I did a mini deep dive on the best ways to get gum
好吧，安吉拉，我要让你知道，我针对如何去除头发上的口香糖做了一次小型深入研究。

487
00:22:43.730 --> 00:22:44.370
out of your hair.
瞧瞧你，女士。

488
00:22:44.590 --> 00:22:45.630
Look at you, lady.
真有你的。

489
00:22:45.790 --> 00:22:46.090
You go.
好吧，花生酱是清除头发上口香糖排名第一的推荐方法。

490
00:22:46.250 --> 00:22:49.550
Well, peanut butter is the number one recommended solution for gum and hair.
但我找到了更多方法。

491
00:22:49.670 --> 00:22:51.030
But I did find more.
大家听好了。

492
00:22:51.470 --> 00:22:52.570
Everybody listen up.
你还可以使用婴儿油、食用油、凡士林、胶水清除剂、蛋黄酱、小苏打加

493
00:22:52.570 --> 00:23:01.330
You can also use baby oil, cooking oil, Vaseline, adhesive remover, mayonnaise, baking soda with
水、柠檬汁、白醋、冰块。

494
00:23:01.330 --> 00:23:04.690
water, lemon juice, white vinegar, ice.
我想你可以把它冻住，然后它就会碎掉。

495
00:23:05.010 --> 00:23:07.990
I guess you can freeze it out and then it, like, breaks up.
但这是我个人最喜欢的，而且我知道我爸爸也很喜欢它，那就是WD-40防锈剂。

496
00:23:08.110 --> 00:23:13.270
But here was my personal favorite, and I know my dad loves it too, WD-40.
我的意思是，真的是没有什么事是WD-40解决不了的。

497
00:23:14.910 --> 00:23:18.170
I mean, there's just, there's nothing WD-40 can't do.
它能解决所有问题。

498
00:23:18.570 --> 00:23:20.110
It solves every problem.
你知道吗？

499
00:23:20.470 --> 00:23:21.290
You know what?
你刚才说凡士林的时候，我也深有同感。

500
00:23:21.290 --> 00:23:23.190
I felt the same way when you said Vaseline.
我觉得这简直绝了。

501
00:23:23.510 --> 00:23:24.890
That was our family go-to.
那是我们家的万灵药。

502
00:23:25.130 --> 00:23:26.690
I mean, just put some Vaseline on it.
我的意思是，抹点凡士林就行。

503
00:23:26.850 --> 00:23:32.070
You know, if you just have some baby oil, Vaseline, and WD-40 in your house, you can solve
你知道的，只要你家里有一些婴儿油、凡士林和WD-40，你就能解决

504
00:23:32.070 --> 00:23:32.970
almost every problem.
几乎所有的问题。

505
00:23:33.370 --> 00:23:34.370
Yeah, you're set.
没错，你就搞定了。

506
00:23:34.370 --> 00:23:35.890
So that was our cold open.
所以那是我们的开场白。

507
00:23:36.090 --> 00:23:37.850
Now we're going to get into the episode.
现在我们要进入正片了。

508
00:23:38.270 --> 00:23:43.190
Michael arrives at work, and I guess he had a date last night because Dwight asked him
迈克尔到达公司，我猜他昨晚约会了，因为德怀特问他

509
00:23:43.190 --> 00:23:43.810
how it went.
进展怎么样。

510
00:23:44.450 --> 00:23:46.230
We find out it did not go well.
我们发现进展并不顺利。

511
00:23:46.670 --> 00:23:50.650
Actually, he shares that none of his dates have been going well, and he feels like they
事实上，他透露他所有的约会都不顺利，他觉得它们

